---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const siteUrl = "https://byalreves.pages.dev";
---

<Layout
  title="404 — Página no encontrada"
  description="La página que buscas no existe o fue movida. Vuelve al inicio o explora el blog."
  canonical={siteUrl}
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 pb-20 pt-16 md:px-12 md:pt-20">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-60">
      <div class="nanduti-pattern absolute inset-0"></div>
      <div class="absolute left-0 top-16 h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-neutral-800 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="absolute right-0 top-1/3 hidden h-64 w-64 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 md:block"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-10 left-8 hidden h-20 w-20 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 md:block"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-amber-500">Error 404</span>
        <span class="h-px w-12 bg-neutral-800"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-500">Ruta perdida</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid items-end gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-neutral-500">Asuncion / PY</p>
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-black leading-none tracking-[-0.06em] text-white sm:text-6xl md:text-8xl">
            404
            <span class="mt-2 block font-mono text-lg uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500 md:text-xl">
              página no encontrada
            </span>
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-300 md:text-lg">
            Esta ruta se fue por otro lado. Tal vez cambió de lugar, fue movida o nunca existió.
            El mejor camino es volver al punto de partida o seguir navegando por el blog.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a
              href="/"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-amber-500/70 bg-amber-500 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-black transition hover:bg-amber-400"
            >
              Volver al inicio
              <span class="rounded-full border border-black/20 bg-black/10 p-2 text-black transition group-hover:bg-black group-hover:text-amber-400">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="/blog"
              class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-neutral-800 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-200 transition hover:border-neutral-600 hover:text-white"
            >
              Explorar blog
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-950/60 p-6 shadow-[0_0_0_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.02)] backdrop-blur-sm">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-neutral-500">Sugerencias</p>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
            <a href="/#proyectos" class="group block rounded-xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/50 p-4 transition hover:border-amber-500/70">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                  <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Sección</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-medium text-white">Proyectos</p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-neutral-500 transition group-hover:text-amber-400">→</span>
              </div>
            </a>

            <a href="/#about" class="group block rounded-xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/50 p-4 transition hover:border-amber-500/70">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                  <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Conóceme</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-medium text-white">Sobre mí</p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-neutral-500 transition group-hover:text-amber-400">→</span>
              </div>
            </a>

            <a href="/blog" class="group block rounded-xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/50 p-4 transition hover:border-amber-500/70">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                  <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Escritura</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-medium text-white">Blog</p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-neutral-500 transition group-hover:text-amber-400">→</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
